OL,3,GNEWSAAll you need to know about First
OL,4,ABus York strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of First Bus drivers are due
OL,7,Fto take strike action this weekend in
OL,8,FYork during a pay dispute, with a union
OL,9,Fwarning of "travel chaos". The action
OL,10,Fcoincides with big events including the
OL,11,FChristmas market and the UK Snooker
OL,12,FChampionship. We look at how it may
OL,13,Fimpact residents and visitors along
OL,14,Fwith how to best prepare for journeys.
OL,16,FThe industrial action will only affect
OL,17,Fservices operated by First Bus on
OL,18,FSaturday and Sunday.
OL,20,FCity of York Council said most routes
OL,21,Fwill still operate, but with reduced
OL,22,Ftimetables and earlier finish times.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
